docs {
  # TutoringService.OpenThread

  With a student (staff) or, for a student account, with its tutor (student_id empty); created on first use

  `/ltedu.wellbeing.v1.TutoringService/OpenThread` · unary · `ltedu/wellbeing/v1/tutoring.proto`

